{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "efdd0663269cc204e9058d261594b2553af4153dcd88225c886151c086f6d03c", "ja": "理想と現実と光と", "zh": "理想、现实与光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a68cbad2da7ff330e0b86affb33271621e8fdf4e5b7e1b81157e834b8045f1be", "ja": "翼のことを見つけた貴音は、彼女の本当の\n気持ちを引き出し、プロデューサーに場を\n託した。プロデューサーの言葉によって\n自分自身と落ち着いて向き合った翼は、\nまつりに謝ろうと決意する。", "zh": "发现翼的贵音引出了她真正的心情，并把接下来的事交给了制作人。借助制作人的话语，翼冷静地面对自己，决心向茉莉道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "21a7c47e6d9d5cc58dbeb7dfd1a284d591bdbf6246d601892ed350604ba97a79", "ja": "翼は、どこへ向かったのでしょうか……。", "zh": "翼去了哪里呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "10d25c2c9938bc505d17c83cf703618bd01f83d9a203a4f79c4b5da97899bdba", "ja": "着信……{$P$}からのようです。\n……もしもし。", "zh": "来电……好像是{$P$}打来的。\n……喂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "c749239e13eb1a59c94bd4bb0d1746cbeab1a77ee866b5709285252cb77a86a4", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょうど良いところに。\n少々、お力をお貸しいただきたいのですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}，您来得正好。\n能否请您助我一臂之力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2241318b8b10558b880102549862219fc5a7d08ba238c9ba5b70f8d37993fad1", "ja": "どうしよう……わたし……。", "zh": "怎么办……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "b4e6286ab4570c526b914f82e1c6b92078250627f4053578c9884489be4ae2a3", "ja": "こんなところにいたのですね。\n探しましたよ、翼。", "zh": "原来你在这种地方啊。\n我找了你好久，翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d695a368e4ad0e35d2d66bc30bd75c527a0cfaf51c9d53a0734e64ccc91c03bc", "ja": "あ、貴音さん……。\nどうしてここに……じゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，贵音小姐……\n您怎么会在这里……不对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "518a771a599b54d4ce18b400b485c42a0b7a556d3241881a3b3efdf05c48e214", "ja": "その……ごめんなさい。わたし……。", "zh": "那个……对不起。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "685ed1a739143dad6e04dbfd190234bf1368db50a05247b60400e9c1c7c3be63", "ja": "いいえ。私たちも、もう少し時間をかけて\n翼の話を聞くべきでした。", "zh": "不。我们也本该多花些时间，\n好好听一听翼的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "4bc032a182c7e0f5d083d6888ba0ee03e6b710d2c044368258304ed565f46483", "ja": "翼が本当にやりたかった事は、特殊な技や、\n派手な仕掛けではないのではありませんか？", "zh": "翼真正想做的事，难道不是特殊的技巧或华丽的机关吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8e9c47a0038d2501da251f775296c73bae67c88e3292a23b1f522365132854e5", "ja": "わたし……すごくすごく、がんばったから。\nリーダーにも、選んでもらったし。", "zh": "我……真的很努力很努力了啊。\n而且大家还选了我当队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "7b164dc8865c6469b9cc78cbaecb38993e6173ff44cbd99574b25b8b144b20a4", "ja": "ええ。実際、よく頑張っていたと思いますよ。", "zh": "嗯。事实上，我觉得你真的很努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ac1d6329e82959f54044fbe5024277c8e7d43c284daef03b279375123671c118", "ja": "でしょ？　……だから、みんなが一生忘れないくらい、\nすごいライブにして、驚かせたかったの。", "zh": "对吧？……所以，我想办一场精彩到让大家一辈子都忘不了的演唱会，让大家大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f95da34652c8990021ee27220448d6ba80a40699834a3d809a22165f8cec88ba", "ja": "わたしたちだけじゃなくて、ファンのみんなにも。\n{$P$}さんにも……。", "zh": "不仅是我们，还有粉丝大家。\n还有{$P$}先生也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "e665c70116021d91e5a52f3d9d0b665367d9e1310aabd4e1f37602dbed141207", "ja": "そうでしたか。……翼は、皆で、\n大きな思い出を作りたかったのですね。", "zh": "原来如此……翼是想和大家一起，创造一段珍贵的回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "69973989f366695706b5563fc8a1305300c74dcc4b6a04a86ef782056afbdac5", "ja": "でも、失敗しちゃった。\n……みんな、呆れてるよね。", "zh": "可是，还是失败了。\n……大家都对我失望了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "845edcf563d5302a40ca898bbd48afdcb2eb61790953501cedabe46906c4e84f", "ja": "責めているのではありません。翼が誰より\n一生懸命であった事を、私たちは知っています。", "zh": "并不是在责备你。我们知道，翼比任何人都更加努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "9c94372be0fa0382c7a12660ebf0dfc8ea6bbfbc1c79888293f1fbfb7a3afd00", "ja": "翼の熱量に引き寄せられ導かれ、何処へ向かうのか……\n私たちは、それを楽しみにしていたのですよ。", "zh": "被翼的热情所吸引和引领，我们也一直期待着，自己究竟会走向何方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "bdb6b088f4626861892f63fd72b6a2f8438f44f07d7c5e92b1f5af08edc319d9", "ja": "そんな翼に感銘を受け、最も支えようとしていたのは\n……まつり姫だったのではありませんか？", "zh": "被这样的翼所打动，最想支持她的人……不就是茉莉公主吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cddffcf7a945832f53dbeb18a03866ceba08d6d8196bbcca9c042ce48f84c906", "ja": "翼、貴音！\nよかった、ここにいたのか。", "zh": "翼、贵音！太好了，原来你们在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "9494ac7aa147216e15d8eaaca89079d95b98d873e4576d7b58aabba41b0f4249", "ja": "{$P$}……お待ちしておりました。\n後の事は、あなた様にお任せします。", "zh": "{$P$}……一直在等您。\n之后的事，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "dd949492398ae5f1c9dd78c8ed12325582ca3a9f0b1e1fae3bbe330058bdf451", "ja": "どうかゆっくりと、翼の話を聞いてあげてください。\nでは。", "zh": "请您慢慢听翼说完。\n那么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7325ad6347089349e3c085fc81df0ad42471fbee53a29a2ced843d4d02328c04", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\nありがとう、貴音！", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n谢谢你，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "84764340bb963c7794b5138731a07fd5aa85b34c3e461b7f6250e5d5ac3b2fcc", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n何があったか、もう聞いた？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你已经听说发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9b651ba0f524124ddf7e431a36b9e578a28ea8ffed5bb0094236ee7fb94ed1dd", "ja": "貴音から、少しだけな。", "zh": "我只从贵音那里听说了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a280c2143ffb2d929bf885196bd29d990c24ae11e9fa54b4a0e12193456a333", "ja": "そっか。\n……わたし、まつりさんにひどいこと言っちゃった。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……我对茉莉小姐说了很过分的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9173bd6b8429157064d3dd2e17d910694d1404e0cfa8c14af5527d22be1c0830", "ja": "まつりさんのこと、嫌いなんかじゃないのに。\nなのに、わたし……大っ嫌い、って……。", "zh": "明明一点都不讨厌小祭……  \n可我却说了“最讨厌你”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9", "ja": "そうか。", "zh": "这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9929699a234e1189368d6823efb9f9248018b841142fde7f5db9a6c230deb97a", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}さん。\nわたしのいいところって、なに……？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}先生。\n我的优点，到底是什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5d88d36b3ab4d64535934a610cbe7f5fa3fa67e2580c8d5e6a95af04151c7959", "ja": "わたし、リーダーやれるって思ってた。だって\nわたしが、こんなにもがんばってるんだから……。", "zh": "我还以为自己能当好队长呢。明明\n我都已经这么努力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d8aa2c95d7d5665b74bc06fb65cf1ad6c044be2d7a708d61438ad2be3f55eb09", "ja": "でもわたしより、ほかのみんなの方が、ずっと……。", "zh": "可是，比起我，其他人都更加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d567290be7f35726ec3c11e5cf954c84c7435eabc8c1ba6d62ad0170b403895", "ja": "ずっと、大人で……正しいよ…………。", "zh": "一直都更成熟……也都是对的…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f4882cb522395d5fa8fb10ff0d4e81bff8de83262615d48f70e95d2ce814f63", "ja": "あーあ。未来とか静香ちゃんと一緒のチームだったら、\nもっとうまく、リーダーやれてたのかな……。", "zh": "唉。要是和未来或者静香一组的话，\n我是不是就能把队长当得更好一点呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "763a26e2d9069f07b16b2fe89514734c2304b488b514b311f689b060eb287c9a", "ja": "……そうだな、確かにそうかもしれない。\nでも俺は、それが正しいとは思わないよ。", "zh": "……也是啊，说不定确实如此。\n但我并不觉得那样做就是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2a7d2e63f05795c3894074cd68e8abc7104a101e5115b84a91456c437d504e98", "ja": "？　どうして……？", "zh": "？为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "2d3b71e85b743255df07d230ee281e84dd9b1d9160c00b6f039f271326fff672", "ja": "もしも翼が正しい大人だったら、4人は\n今みたいなチームになってなかったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "要是翼是个端正的大人，你们4个人\n或许就不会成为现在这样的团队了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "55199099f9153f4f11b76cb35d3bbb87eda45463749a12a9856bc29f6b0a155e", "ja": "翼が翼なりに真剣に考えて、そうやって頑張る姿を\nみんなに見せたから、ここまでこれたんだと思う。", "zh": "我觉得正是因为翼认真地用自己的方式思考，并把自己努力的样子展现给大家看，我们才能走到今天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "169495274e04216e98600745b05c8cf529c7b24ebdd38929a4c55c47e5528e4e", "ja": "……そう、なのかな。", "zh": "……是，这样吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "f160e83c52f6262e0d1b747c6a99a8145cc367c41a30c1d272ce7247005e354b", "ja": "ああ。貴音も恵美も、それからまつりだって。\nみんな、翼の熱に引っ張られて、ここまで来たんだ。", "zh": "啊。贵音也好，惠美也好，还有茉莉也是。\n大家都是被翼的热情带动着，才一路走到今天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "fe765bfc02fd1b0360fa68ff07793653cdef0e5cda9099d8850039b7992dd5d9", "ja": "翼が頑張ってるから、自分も負けたくないって。\nこのチームは、そうやってできたんだよ。", "zh": "大家都想着，翼这么努力，自己也不能输给她。这个团队就是这样组成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "876bc4d92a860a858b7fefc6bc04682ec2ed62129f89e61abf243ab1ee77753d", "ja": "そんな風に周囲を巻き込む力を持っている翼は、\nやっぱりリーダーに向いてると俺は思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，拥有这样感染周围人的力量，翼果然很适合当队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4500dd8df01f58dd2d3be0473bec415e89c5623ea427413923f13bfb265ebf41", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nうん。わかった。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嗯，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_05_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7f76ecae643b9f5872ff2b6438708a31595cb9e169744c214b602d16a7db8a59", "ja": "わたし、戻る！　\n戻って、まつりさんに謝らなくちゃ……！", "zh": "我要回去！\n得回去跟茉莉前辈道歉才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
